#: ../../source/guides/formats/index.md:1
msgid "Formats"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/formats/index.md:3
msgid ""
"A **format** is the recipe for one report layout: `EURIZON-EN23`, "
"`AMUNDI-IT24`. It carries the publication year because a layout is a "
"snapshot — next year's report from the same issuer is a different format,"
" not a revision of this one."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/formats/index.md:7
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Formats do not live in the engine. They live in a **formats repository**,"
" and this area is about what you put in one and how you work on it. Why "
"they live outside is {doc}`../../reference/design/formats-as-plugins`."
msgstr ""

